# Coolify Deployment
# Deploy via Coolify: https://coolify.io

# Option 1: Simple Docker Compose
# 1. Create a new application in Coolify
# 2. Choose "Public Repository" or "Private Repository"
# 3. Set branch to main
# 4. Coolify auto-detects docker-compose.yml
# 5. Configure persistent volume at /app/db
# 6. Set environment variables

# Option 2: Nixpacks Build
# Build Command: npm ci && npx prisma generate && npm run build
# Start Command: node .next/standalone/server.js

# coolify.env
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3000
DATABASE_URL=file:/app/db/reconpro.db
